    "text": "By Zach Lewis ,\n1 days ago UTICA, N.Y. -- A bat in South Utica tested positive for rabies. According to the Oneida County Health Department, the bat was tested on Aug. 21, and positive results were reported on Aug. 26. Two people and one cat were exposed to the bat. The individuals received post-exposure treatment, and... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
